Analyze what happens in this case. Tracing this code:
int[] a = {6, 8, 9, 12, 15, 16, 17, 19, 23};
int lo = 0, hi = a.length - 1, steps = 0;
while (lo <= hi) { int mid = (lo + hi) / 2; steps++; if (a[mid] == 9) return mid; if (a[mid] < 9) lo = mid + 1; else hi = mid - 1; }
return -1;

